s and constructing a witness that exposes incompatible conditions.","learningObjective":"Practices merging forced monotonic constraints and constructing a witness that exposes incompatible conditions."},{"title":"Subsequences (easy version)","source":"Codeforces","ref":"1183/E","url":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1183/problem/E","rating":2000,"ratingKind":"official","level":"Practice","priority":false,"tags":["bfs","strings"],"ratingBasis":"Official Codeforces rating field from the retained successful API snapshot;contest points are not used as difficulty.","ratingConfidence":"official","ratingSource":"https://codeforces.com/api/problemset.problems","ratingVerifiedAt":"2026-10-27","sourceTags":["dp","graphs","implementation","shortest paths"],"priorityLevel":"medium","priorityReason":"Useful shortest-deletion/state-dedup practice for generating distinct subsequences;the easy version supports a direct search model.","learningObjective":"Useful shortest-deletion/state-dedup practice for generating distinct subsequences;the easy version supports a direct search model."},{"title":"Cover it!","source":"Codeforces","ref":"1176/E","url":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1176/problem/E","rating":1700,"ratingKind":"official","level":"Practice","priority":false,"tags":["graphs","bfs"],"ratingBasis":"Official Codeforces rating field from the retained successful API snapshot;contest points are not used as difficulty.","ratingConfidence":"official","ratingSource":"https://codeforces.com/api/problemset.problems","ratingVerifiedAt":"2026-10-27","sourceTags":["dfs and similar","dsu","graphs","shortest paths","trees"],"priorityLevel":"medium","priorityReason":"A concise BFS-layer parity selection exercise;careful attention to the requested coverage property matters.","learningObjective":"A concise BFS-layer parity selection exercise;careful attention to the requested coverage property matters."},{"title":"News Distribution","source":"Codeforces","ref":"1167/C","url":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1167/problem/C","rating":1400,"ratingKind":"official","level":"Practice","priority":true,"tags":["dsu"],"ratingBasis":"Official Codeforces rating field from the retained successful API snapshot;contest points are not used as difficulty.","ratingConfidence":"official","ratingSource":"https://codeforces.com/api/problemset.problems","ratingVerifiedAt":"2026-10-27","sourceTags":["dfs and similar","dsu","graphs"],"priorityLevel":"high","priorityReason":"An approachable group-connectivity problem that teaches unioning a whole group through one representative.","learningObjective":"An approachable group-connectivity problem that teaches unioning a whole group through one representative."},{"title":"Clear the String","source":"Codeforces","ref":"1132/F","url":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1132/problem/F","rating":2000,"ratingKind":"official","level":"Practice","priority":true,"tags":["interval dp","strings"],"ratingBasis":"Official Codeforces rating field from the retained successful API snapshot;contest points are not used as difficulty.","ratingConfidence":"official","ratingSource":"https://codeforces.com/api/problemset.problems","ratingVerifiedAt":"2026-10-27","sourceTags":["dp"],"priorityLevel":"high","priorityReason":"A strong interval-DP example where equal symbols can merge operations;teaches why greedy deletion can fail.","learningObjective":"A strong interval-DP example where equal symbols can merge operations;teaches why greedy deletion can fail."},{"title":"Flood Fill","source":"Codeforces","ref":"1114/D","url":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1114/problem/D","rating":1900,"ratingKind":"official","level":"Practice","priority":true,"tags":["interval dp","dynamic programming"],"ratingBasis":"Official Codeforces rating field from the retained successful API snapshot;contest points are not used as difficulty.","ratingConfidence":"official","ratingSource":"https://codeforces.com/api/problemset.problems","ratingVerifiedAt":"2026-10-27","sourceTags":["dp"],"priorityLevel":"high","priorityReason":"Develops interval expansion and compression of repeated colors;good practice reducing a state space before DP.","learningObjective":"Develops interval expansion and compression of repeated colors;good practice reducing a state space before DP."}]$owner245$;r record;p jsonb;payload jsonb;n bigint;task_id text;pack text;rate integer;stored jsonb;
begin
 if md5(manifest::text)<>'ef2a525b4dc4d3072a4c07b36ee74835'or jsonb_array_length(manifest)<>245 then raise exception 'Immutable245manifest mismatch';end if;
 insert into pg_temp.p4_owner_inputs select ord::integer,value from jsonb_array_elements(manifest)with ordinality x(value,ord);
 -- Validate the entire allowlist before consuming any sequence numbers.
 for r in select * from pg_temp.p4_owner_inputs order by ord loop
  if r.body ?| array['id','number','statement','editorial','hints','hintsEn','editorialUrl']then raise exception 'Forbidden assignedID/optional content';end if;
  p:=public.validate_learning_problem(r.body);
  if p->>'priorityLevel'not in('low','medium','high')or nullif(btrim(p->>'priorityReason'),'')is null or p->>'ratingKind'not in('official','estimated')or nullif(btrim(p->>'ratingBasis'),'')is null or nullif(btrim(p->>'ratingSource'),'')is null then raise exception 'Required priority/rating provenance missing';end if;
  if p->>'ratingKind'='official'and(p->>'source'<>'Codeforces'or nullif(p->>'ratingVerifiedAt','')is null)then raise exception 'Invalid official provenance';end if;
  if p->>'ratingKind'='estimated'and(nullif(p->>'ratingEstimatedAt','')is null or nullif(p->>'ratingConfidence','')is null)then raise exception 'Missing estimate provenance';end if;
  if not exists(select 1 from public.problem_sources where lower(name)=lower(p->>'source'))then raise exception 'Missing approved source;no registry writes';end if;
  if exists(select 1 from public.problem_catalog c where lower(regexp_replace(regexp_replace(rtrim(split_part(split_part(c.body->>'url','?',1),'#',1),'/'),'^https://www[.]codeforces[.]com/','https://codeforces.com/'),'^https://codeforces[.]com/problemset/problem/([0-9]+)/([A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9]*)$','https://codeforces.com/contest/\1/problem/\2'))=lower(regexp_replace(regexp_replace(rtrim(split_part(split_part(p->>'url','?',1),'#',1),'/'),'^https://www[.]codeforces[.]com/','https://codeforces.com/'),'^https://codeforces[.]com/problemset/problem/([0-9]+)/([A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9]*)$','https://codeforces.com/contest/\1/problem/\2')) or(lower(c.body->>'source')=lower(p->>'source')and lower(replace(c.body->>'ref','/',''))=lower(replace(p->>'ref','/',''))))then raise exception 'Existing or archived identity conflict';end if;
 end loop;
 if exists(select 1 from pg_temp.p4_owner_inputs group by lower(regexp_replace(regexp_replace(rtrim(split_part(split_part(body->>'url','?',1),'#',1),'/'),'^https://www[.]codeforces[.]com/','https://codeforces.com/'),'^https://codeforces[.]com/problemset/problem/([0-9]+)/([A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9]*)$','https://codeforces.com/contest/\1/problem/\2'))having count(*)>1)or exists(select 1 from pg_temp.p4_owner_inputs group by lower(body->>'source'),lower(replace(body->>'ref','/',''))having count(*)>1)then raise exception 'Duplicate allowlist identity';end if;
 for r in select * from pg_temp.p4_owner_inputs order by ord loop
  p:=public.validate_learning_problem(r.body);rate:=(p->>'rating')::integer;n:=nextval('public.problem_number_seq');
  task_id:=case when lower(p->>'source')='cses'and p->>'ref'~'^[0-9]+$'then 'cses-'||(p->>'ref')when lower(p->>'source')='atcoder'and p->>'ref'~*'^dp_[a-z]$'then 'atcoder-'||lower(p->>'ref')else 'task-'||n::text end;
  pack:=case when lower(p->>'source')='cses'then'cses'when lower(p->>'source')='egoi'then'egoi'when rate<=1100 then'foundation'when rate<=1500 then'core'when rate<=1800 then'challenge'when rate<=2100 then'stretch'else'advanced'end;
  payload:=p||jsonb_build_object('id',task_id,'number',n,'pack',pack,'priority',p->>'priorityLevel'='high','hints','[]'::jsonb,'hintsEn','[]'::jsonb,'lesson','');
  insert into public.problem_catalog(problem_id,number,body,revision,archived)values(task_id,n,payload,1,false);
  insert into public.problem_changes(problem_id,actor_id,action,previous_body,next_body)values(task_id,null,'create',null,payload);
  select body into stored from public.problem_catalog where problem_id=task_id;
  if not stored @> r.body then raise exception 'Metadata preservation failed';end if;
  insert into pg_temp.p4_owner_receipts values(r.ord,task_id,n,stored);
 end loop;
 if(select count(*)from public.problem_catalog)<>993 or(select count(*)from pg_temp.p4_owner_receipts)<>245 then raise exception 'Final count mismatch';end if;
 if exists(select 1 from pg_temp.p4_owner_before b left join public.problem_catalog kept using(problem_id)where to_jsonb(kept)is distinct from b.row)then raise exception 'Existing row changed';end if;
if md5(replace(pg_get_functiondef('public.is_admin()'::regprocedure),E'\r\n',E'\n'))<>'5e9198d378eb116e17553d1b2b861b26'then raise exception 'Function baseline drift:is_admin';end if;
 if md5(replace(pg_get_functiondef('public.admin_save_problem(jsonb,bigint,integer)'::regprocedure),E'\r\n',E'\n'))<>'dacc200a2a3c0db0c9911c1cd16964ae'then raise exception 'Function baseline drift:admin_save_problem';end if;
 if md5(replace(pg_get_functiondef('public.validate_learning_problem(jsonb)'::regprocedure),E'\r\n',E'\n'))<>'670d939c72ef36a1bb9153d536415383'then raise exception 'Function baseline drift:validate_learning_problem';end if;
 if md5(replace(pg_get_functiondef('public.validate_priority_metadata(jsonb)'::regprocedure),E'\r\n',E'\n'))<>'b42556530c4bbdd6b0b91b5e401b3996'then raise exception 'Function baseline drift:validate_priority_metadata';end if;
end$job$;
commit;
-- This final SELECT returns receipts after the commit;on uncertain response re-read identities,never blindly retry.
select jsonb_build_object('operation','part04_owner_245_metadata','actor_kind','database_owner_maintenance_no_app_impersonation','before_count',748,'after_count',993,'created',245,'receipts',(select jsonb_agg(to_jsonb(r)order by ord)from pg_temp.p4_owner_receipts r))as result;
